{"reviewId": "17139892_81AZeljFp", "review": {"abstract": "不过，对于2015年左右到来的长波萧条，我们似乎应该提高警惕，因为在我们所观察到的例证中，大国工业化在长波萧条期基本上都处于停滞状态（见表5-5）。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "chapterUid": 10, "content": "按照理论应该是25年底结束萧条期进入复苏，但是15年的政策干预加上20年疫情影响保守估计萧条期被推迟至少到2028年结束", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "13945-14019", "createTime": 1752343364, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "17139892_81AZeljFp", "userVid": 17139892, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 10, "chapterTitle": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "author": {"userVid": 17139892, "name": "🐳空白", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/hNWCQ9bibbzGwmx2pVUianIED6Zwibk51yk6F5N1gN0OWnvtnYGOaQgEta6yGveVxhVyLarFrjCg4w/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "🐳空白", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 24, "likes": [{"userVid": 288886685, "name": "谢留杰", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/TkbpicfHnsHBd3e1IACoQsoZ8kH5hHYyhu8ApKHibaV1WzAQ0zVBGIKsftznfFrxUE0MHzjuLvHzvjrz4euBXu5g/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}], "commentsCount": 5, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "早几年晚几年普通人可能没法确定，能确定的是复苏期不远了", "reviewId": "17139892_81AZeljFp", "commentId": "17139892_